  internalStructure: Mercury has a large iron-rich metallic core a silicate mantle
    and a thin rocky crust. Its core occupies a substantial fraction of the planet's
    interior.
  surfaceAndRings: Mercury has a heavily cratered surface including the Caloris Basin.
    It has no planetary ring system.
  magneticField: Mercury possesses a weak global magnetic field generated by processes
    within its partially liquid core.
